    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/5339dba135094d327039cfc800e968b3.poster.avif?t=1686361175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/5339dba135094d327039cfc800e968b3.webm?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/5339dba135094d327039cfc800e968b3.mp4?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Dash out is a minimalist musical game where the world dance with the music. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/0710bbdd40a282f5b2c33dd5a610f6a0.poster.avif?t=1686361175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/0710bbdd40a282f5b2c33dd5a610f6a0.webm?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/0710bbdd40a282f5b2c33dd5a610f6a0.mp4?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Move through the dots and reach the end of level. <br>Listen to an awesome dynamic music while you dance with the world. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/388957fa0f98958648ee05bf820f58c2.poster.avif?t=1686361175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/388957fa0f98958648ee05bf820f58c2.webm?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/388957fa0f98958648ee05bf820f58c2.mp4?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can explore the world or.. just stay and relax. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/b0f37fc8da406848941b9c64252bcc16.poster.avif?t=1686361175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/b0f37fc8da406848941b9c64252bcc16.webm?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/b0f37fc8da406848941b9c64252bcc16.mp4?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Every level has a different challenge that you need to pass, and you have a lot of them. <br>Rhythmic objects and enemies will try to block your path. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/7545c971d7a6c4c5a5ca2d05f72a2ef5.poster.avif?t=1686361175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/7545c971d7a6c4c5a5ca2d05f72a2ef5.webm?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558200/extras/7545c971d7a6c4c5a5ca2d05f72a2ef5.mp4?t=1686361175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
